statement:
Prove that if \(a, b,\) and \(c\) are positive integers with \(a \ge b \ge c\) such that
\begin{align*}
a^2 - b^2 - c^2 + ab &= 2011, \\
a^2 + 3b^2 + 3c^2 - 3ab - 2ac - 2bc &= -1997,
\end{align*}
then \(a = 253\).

